{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SalesOrders\">Sales Orders</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyReserved\">Qty reserved</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem InventoryItems Item On Sales SalesOrder To ToDate\">The <strong>Quantity Reserved</strong> screen shows inventory items reserved on a specific sales order.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And By Delivered HasOrderBy Is Item On Remaining Sales SalesOrder Status To ToDate\">This screen helps you track the fulfillment status of each item on the sales order by displaying ordered quantities, delivered quantities, and remaining quantities to be delivered.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem Is Item On Sales SalesOrder To ToDate\">Displays the <em>inventory item</em> that was ordered on this sales order.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOrdered\">Qty Ordered</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOrdered\">Qty Ordered</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Custom Customer Is Item To ToDate Total\">Shows the total quantity ordered by the customer for this item.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyDelivered\">Qty delivered</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyDelivered\">Qty delivered</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Custom Customer Delivered Is Item On To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">Shows the quantity already delivered to the customer. Click the value to view the delivery transactions for this item.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyInvoiced\">Qty Invoiced</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyInvoiced\">Qty Invoiced</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Custom Customer Invoice Invoiced Is Item On Sales SalesInvoice To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">Shows the quantity that has been invoiced to the customer. Click the value to view the sales invoice transactions for this item.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyReserved\">Qty reserved</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyReserved\">Qty reserved</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Delivered Is Remaining Sales SalesOrder To ToDate\">Shows the remaining quantity reserved for the customer. This is the quantity still to be delivered to fulfill the sales order.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "sales-order-qty-reserved"
}
